	"Description": "Generic actor pooling system for reducing spawn/destroy churn and replication cost in multiplayer games. Poolable via a Blueprint-implementable interface; supports recyclable and non-recyclable pools, per-class size overrides, and a helper component for non-replicated client-side cosmetic actors (e.g. projectiles).",
